erto Monteagudo, un exitoso hombre de negocios, llegará para conquistar su corazón, pero también el de Daniela. Los impulsos destructivos de Alma jugarán en su contra y tendrá que decidir entre perseguir la venganza o el amor.\",\"talent\":\"Eduardo Capetillo, Gabriela Spanic, Jorge Alberti, Michelle Vieth, Saby Kamalich, Sergio Kleiner\",\"unix_begin\":1786474800,\"unix_end\":1786478400,\"duration\":\"01:00:00\",\"language\":\"esp\",\"type\":\"0\",\"group_id\":\"898414\",\"confirmado\":null,\"id_empleado\":null,\"tms_id\":null,\"event_alf_id\":\"d0a748212667\",\"ext_ncont_id\":\"735561720587\",\"ext_nevt_id\":\"d0a748212667\",\"ext_actors\":null,\"ext_director\":\"Magda Crisantes\",\"ext_year\":\"2012\",\"ext_country\":\"MEX\",\"ext_original_name\":\"La Otra Cara Del Alma\",\"ext_ep_original_name\":null,\"ext_series_id\":\"735561720510\",\"ext_season_id\":\"00\",\"ext_episode_id\":\"00077\",\"ext_language\":\"spa\",\"ext_serie_short_desc\":null,\"ext_serie_desc\":null,\"ext_episode_name\":null,\"ext_season_number\":\"0\",\"ext_episode_number\":\"77\",\"image_base_horizontal\":\"\",\"image_base_vertical\":\"\",\"image_base_square\":\"\",\"ext_eventimage_name\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn8.clarovideo.net\\/EPG\\/38054\\/f22c972efb8ae8076ca3794e38086646_v-168x96.jpg?size=168x96\",\"ext_eventimage_name_base\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn7.clarovideo.net\\/EPG\\/38054\\/f22c972efb8ae8076ca3794e38086646.jpg\",\"ext_catchup\":\"1\",\"ext_startover\":\"1\",\"ext_recordable\":\"1\",\"parental_rating\":\"+16\",\"aud_stereo\":\"0\",\"aud_dolby\":\"0\",\"vid_black_and_white\":\"0\",\"dvb_content\":\"Melodrama, Telenovela\",\"user_content\":null,\"begintime\":\"2026\\/08\\/11 13:00:00\",\"endtime\":\"2026\\/08\\/11 14:00:00\",\"SOURCE_URI\":null}],\"past\":[{\"channel_id\":\"38466\",\"channel_number\":1514,\"channel_name\":\"RAI\",\"channel_group_id\":\"898330\",\"channel_liveref\":\"O2RAIHD\",\"channel_image\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn2.clarovideo.net\\/CVPERU\\/PELICULAS\\/R