 adolescente de 16 años y él un hombre de 41.\",\"short_description\":null,\"image_large\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn8.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/SS\\/11902WHORIZONTAL.jpg?size=675x380\",\"image_medium\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn6.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/SS\\/11902WVERTICAL.jpg?size=200x300\",\"image_small\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn8.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/SS\\/11902WHORIZONTAL.jpg?size=290x163\",\"image_still\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn6.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/PELICULAS\\/906090DIARIOSECRETODEUNAADOLESCENTECAP1HDPA1-01-01-01\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/STILLS\\/906090DIARIOSECRETODEUNAADOLESCENTECAP1HDPA1-01-01-01-STILL-02.jpg\",\"image_background\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn6.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/906090DIARIOSECRETODEUNAADOLESCENTE-01-01-00\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/CLEAN\\/906090DIARIOSECRETODEUNAADOLESCENTE-01-01-00_e-1280x720.jpg\",\"image_background_blur\":null,\"url_imagen_t1\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn9.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/CLEAN\\/11902WVERTICAL.jpg?size=200x300\",\"url_imagen_t2\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn1.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/CLEAN\\/11902WHORIZONTAL.jpg?size=290x163\",\"image_base_horizontal\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn5.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/SS\\/11902WHORIZONTAL.jpg\",\"image_base_vertical\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn3.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/SS\\/11902WVERTICAL.jpg\",\"image_base_square\":\"\",\"image_clean_horizontal\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn8.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/CLEAN\\/11902WHORIZONTAL.jpg\",\"image_clean_vertical\":\"https:\\/\\/clarovideocdn6.clarovideo.net\\/ATRESPLAYER\\/SERIES\\/11902\\/EXPORTACION_WEB\\/CLEAN\\/11902WVERTICAL.jpg\",\"image_clean_square\":\"\",\"image_spr